  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Required equation of plane</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Given that its distance from origin is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msqrt><mn>21</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p>Thus,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msqrt><mn>21</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>21</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>14</mn><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>336</mn><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>168</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>28</mn><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>308</mn><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>184</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>308</mn><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>154</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>30</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>154</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>15</mn><mn>154</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>, required plane is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>",
